{"about_the_game":"Sorcerer's Tournament is a turn-based RPG with mini-games for training your character, gameplay is focused on growing and improving between each duel. <br>As you win duels and tournaments you will permanently unlock new spells, modes and difficulties. <br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1822940/extras/pick-base-gif-exact-size.gif?t=1640205415\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Winning Through Sheer Force Is Not The Only Option</h2> In this game's duels you will face opponents that might out-last you rather than out-damage you.<br><br> <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1822940/extras/shooting-base-gif-exact-size.gif?t=1640205415\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Train Your Student And Manage Your Time Carefully</h2>Use the time you have to train carefully as an extra damage might not be as important as learning that new spell.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features Include</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  learn unique spells that can fuse with modifiers into 110 spell combinations<br></li><li>  choose the school and student <br></li><li> play challenging mini-games training each major stat<br></li><li> unlock special game modes<br></li><li> fight magic battles to your heart's content!</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1822940?t=1640205415","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1822940?t=1640205415","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1822940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1640205415","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1822940/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1640205415","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"con